##  Fire and Smoke Detection using YOLOv12 ##

<p align="center">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue.svg">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/YOLO-v12-red.svg">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/OpenCV-Computer%20Vision-green.svg">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Completed-success.svg">
</p>

Real-time **Fire and Smoke Detection System** built with **YOLOv12**, **OpenCV**, and **Python**.

The model detects:

- 🔥 **Fire**
- 🌫️ **Smoke**

and automatically draws bounding boxes with confidence scores on images and videos.

---

## 🎥 Demo

<p align="center">
  <img src="video_test/forest_fire_test.gif" width="800">
</p>

---

## ✨ Features

✔️ Real-time fire and smoke detection

✔️ Video and image inference

✔️ YOLOv12 custom-trained model

✔️ Bounding boxes with confidence scores

✔️ OpenCV visualization

✔️ Fast and lightweight architecture

✔️ Easy to deploy

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
Fire-Smoke-Detection-YOLO12
│
├── fire_smoke.py              # Real-time detection using OpenCV
├── detect_video.py            # Video prediction script
├── fire_smoke_detect.ipynb    # Model training notebook
├── best.pt                    # Trained weights
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
│
├── video_test/
│   ├── fire-smoke-detect.mp4
│   └── forest_fire_test.gif
│
└── runs/
    └── detect/
```

---

## ⚙️ Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Fire-Smoke-Detection-YOLO12.git

cd Fire-Smoke-Detection-YOLO12
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 🚀 Run Real-Time Detection

```bash
python fire_smoke.py
```

This script:

- Reads a video stream
- Detects fire and smoke
- Draws bounding boxes
- Displays confidence scores in real time

---

## 🎬 Run Video Prediction

```bash
python detect_video.py
```

Predicted videos are saved automatically inside:

```text
runs/detect/predict/
```

---

## 🧠 Model

Model used:

- **YOLOv12 Nano (YOLOv12n)**

### Classes

| ID | Class |
|----|--------|
| 0 | 🔥 Fire |
| 1 | 🌫️ Smoke |

---

## 📊 Results

Example detections:

| Class | Confidence |
|---------|------------|
| 🔥 Fire | 79.7% |
| 🌫️ Smoke | 42.4% |

Inference speed:

- ⚡ ~200 ms/frame on CPU
- 🚀 Faster on GPU

